# Phase 2 — Project Management Implementation Plan

This plan details the implementation of Phase 2, which allows users to create and manage projects, and generate unique API keys for sending logs.

## Goal

Allow users to create and manage projects. Every project represents an application and receives a unique API key.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> This phase includes database schema changes. A new migration will be created and applied. Please ensure you are okay with running `drizzle-kit push` or `generate/migrate` during the execution phase.

