## Proposed Changes

### Database

#### [MODIFY] [schema.ts](file:///c:/Users/ohioa/Projects/React/logged/db/schema.ts)
- Add `description`, `website`, and `environment` fields to the `projects` table.

### API Routes

#### [NEW] [route.ts](file:///c:/Users/ohioa/Projects/React/logged/app/api/projects/route.ts)
- `GET /api/projects`: Return all projects for the authenticated user.
- `POST /api/projects`: Create a new project, generate an API key, and store it.

#### [NEW] [route.ts](file:///c:/Users/ohioa/Projects/React/logged/app/api/projects/[id]/route.ts)
- `GET /api/projects/[id]`: Get details of a single project.
- `PATCH /api/projects/[id]`: Update project details (name, description, website, environment).
- `DELETE /api/projects/[id]`: Delete a project and its associated data.

#### [NEW] [route.ts](file:///c:/Users/ohioa/Projects/React/logged/app/api/projects/[id]/regenerate-key/route.ts)
- `POST /api/projects/[id]/regenerate-key`: Generate and return a new API key for the project.

